Once you’ve purchased a beat on Beat22, you can easily access your files including the license, audio files, invoice, and receipt, anytime from your account. Follow these simple steps:

## **How to access your purchased orders:**

**1\. Log in to your Beat22 account** Visit [beat22.com](https://beat22.com) and sign in with your buyer account. **2\. Click on “Browse” at the top** Once logged in, you’ll see the **“Browse”** button at the top of the page. Click on it.

![1\. Log in to your Beat22 account Visit beat22.com and sign in with your buyer account. 2\. Click on “Browse”](/images/2025/07/Screenshot-2025-07-01-152726.png)

**3\. Go to “My Orders”** In the dropdown, click on **“My Orders”**. This will open your full order history.

![3\. Go to “My Orders” In the dropdown, click on “My Orders”. This will open your full order history.](/images/2025/07/Screenshot-2025-07-01-152740.png)

**4\. Select the Beat You Purchased** Find the beat you’ve purchased from the list and click on it. **5\. Download Your Files** From the beat’s order details page, you’ll be able to:

-   Download the **media file** (MP3/WAV/Stems)
-   Download the **license PDF**
-   Access your **invoice and payment receipt**

**Quick Tip:** Your files will always remain available in your account under “My Orders.” You can return any time to re-download if needed.
